       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TALLY-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TEXT-LINE   PIC X(30) VALUE "BANANA SPLIT BANANA BREAD".
       01 A-COUNT     PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 WORD-COUNT  PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 LEAD-SPACES PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INSPECT TEXT-LINE TALLYING A-COUNT FOR ALL "A"
           INSPECT TEXT-LINE TALLYING WORD-COUNT FOR ALL "BANANA"
           INSPECT TEXT-LINE TALLYING LEAD-SPACES
               FOR LEADING SPACES
           DISPLAY "LETTER A: " A-COUNT
           DISPLAY "BANANA:   " WORD-COUNT
           STOP RUN.
